do $$ declare m_EP_V4_3 uuid; a_id uuid; q_id uuid; begin
  if not exists (select 1 from public.courses where id = 'EP-V4') then return; end if;
  insert into public.modules (course_id, number, title, title_rw, intro, intro_rw, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V4', 3, 'Resources, Contingency and Emergency Planning', 'Umutungo, Ibitunguranye n''Igenamigambi ry''Ibyihutirwa', 'Subjects 77–88. This module covers perimeter and entry control, staffing, equipment, communications, medical support, emergency and crisis response, evacuation, shelter-in-place, contingency and incident management planning.', 'Ingingo 77–88. Iki gice kigaruka ku murongo w''inyuma no kugenzura abinjira, abakozi, ibikoresho, itumanaho, ubufasha bwa muganga, gutabara mu byihutirwa n''ibihe by''ikibazo, kwimuka, kuguma aho uri, ibitunguranye n''igenamigambi ryo gucunga ibibazo.', 3)
  returning id into m_EP_V4_3;
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '77', 'Perimeter Security Planning', 'Gutegura Umutekano w''Umurongo w''Inyuma', 'text', 'The perimeter defines what is inside and everything within depends on that line holding. Plan it as a continuous boundary rather than as a set of features: every deliberate opening must be staffed or controlled, and every unintended opening — a gap in fencing, an unsecured service gate, a low wall, a neighbouring roof — must be identified in the survey and closed or monitored.

The perimeter should perform all four protective functions in its own right. Deter: does it look difficult enough that an adversary chooses elsewhere. Detect: would a breach be noticed, and by what. Delay: how long would a person be slowed, and is that longer than the response time. Respond: who reacts, how quickly, and from where. The arithmetic matters more than the appearance — a high fence with no detection and a fifteen-minute response provides a delay of seconds against a determined intruder, which is a fence rather than a perimeter.', 'Umurongo w''inyuma usobanura ibiri imbere kandi ibiri imbye byose bishingira ku kuba uwo murongo uhagaze. Uteganye nk''imbibi zikomeza aho kuwuteganya nk''ihuriro ry''ibintu: buri cyuho cyagenwe kigomba kugira abakozi cyangwa kugenzurwa, kandi buri cyuho kitagenwe — icyuho mu rugomero, irembo ry''ibikorwa ritarinzwe, urukuta rugufi, igisenge cy''umuturanyi — kigomba kumenyekana mu isuzuma kikaziba cyangwa kikagenzurwa.

Umurongo w''inyuma ugomba gukora imirimo ine yose yo kurinda ubwawo. Gukumira: ese ugaragara ko ugoye bihagije ku buryo umwanzi ahitamo ahandi. Kumenya: ese kuwuvuna byamenyekana, kandi n''iki. Gutinza: umuntu yatinda igihe kingana iki, kandi ese kirenze igihe cyo gutabara. Gutabara: ni nde usubiza, mu gihe kingana iki, kandi aturuka he. Imibare ifite akamaro kurusha uko bigaragara — urugomero rurerure rudafite ukumenya n''igisubizo cy''iminota cumi n''itanu rutanga gutinza kw''amasegonda ku wafashe umwanzuro, ari urugomero aho kuba umurongo w''inyuma.', 12, 1);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '78', 'Entry and Exit Control', 'Kugenzura Kwinjira no Gusohoka', 'text', 'Entry and exit are the points at which the perimeter is deliberately opened, which makes them both the most controlled and the most exposed locations. Plan them as processes rather than as doors. For entry: how a person is identified, by whom, against what, what happens when identification fails, whether anything is screened and how, how the flow is managed so that a queue does not form outside an uncontrolled area, and what record is kept.

Exit control is frequently neglected and matters for two reasons: it establishes who has left, which is essential during an evacuation headcount, and it addresses removal — of property, of documents, and in some circumstances of a person who should not be departing unaccompanied. Plan the principal''s own entry and exit separately from the general flow wherever possible, since sharing an entrance with an unscreened queue places the principal in the one location where an adversary knows they must eventually appear.', 'Kwinjira no gusohoka ni ahantu umurongo w''inyuma ufungurirwa ku bushake, bigatuma ari ahantu hagenzurwa kurusha ahandi kandi hagaragara kurusha ahandi. Biteganye nk''inzira z''akazi aho kubiteganya nk''imiryango. Ku kwinjira: uko umuntu amenyekana, na nde, hakurikijwe iki, ibibaho iyo kumenyekana kunaniranye, ese hari icyo bagenzura n''uko, uko imigendekere icungwa ku buryo umurongo utabera hanze mu gace katagenzurwa, n''inyandiko ibikwa.

Kugenzura gusohoka gukunze kwirengagizwa kandi bifite akamaro ku mpamvu ebyiri: bishyiraho uwagiye, ari ngombwa mu kubara abantu mu gihe cyo kwimuka, kandi bicyuha gukuramo — ibintu, inyandiko, kandi mu bihe bimwe umuntu utagomba kugenda atari kumwe n''undi. Teganya kwinjira no gusohoka kw''uwo barinda ukwacyo bitandukanye n''imigendekere rusange aho bishoboka, kuko gusangira urwinjiriro n''umurongo utagenzuwe bishyira uwo barinda ahantu hamwe umwanzi azi ko agomba amaherezo kugaragara.', 12, 2);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '79', 'Security Staffing Plans', 'Gahunda z''Abakozi b''Umutekano', 'text', 'A staffing plan derives from the assessment rather than from a standard template or from what is available. It states, for each phase of the engagement: how many officers, in which positions, with what responsibility, for how long and who relieves them. Every position must have a stated purpose — a post nobody can explain the reason for is a post that will be abandoned when resources are short.

Build in relief explicitly, because fatigue degrades observation measurably and an officer holding a critical position at the end of an unbroken long shift is a control that has quietly stopped working. Plan for the phases of highest demand rather than for the average: arrival, departure and any public engagement typically require more officers than the static periods, and a plan sized for the average will be understaffed at exactly the moments that matter. Where the resource available is less than the plan requires, state that explicitly to the client rather than absorbing it silently, because an operation running below its own assessed requirement is a decision the client should make knowingly.', 'Gahunda y''abakozi iva ku isuzuma aho kuva ku rugero rusanzwe cyangwa ku bihari. Ivuga, kuri buri cyiciro cy''akazi: abakozi bangahe, mu bihe bihe, bafite inshingano iki, mu gihe kingana iki na nde ubasimbura. Buri mwanya ugomba kugira intego yavuzwe — umurimo nta muntu ushobora gusobanura impamvu yawo ni umurimo uzasigwa igihe umutungo ari muke.

Shyiramo gusimburana mu buryo bugaragara, kuko umunaniro wangiza kwitegereza bigaragara kandi umukozi ufite umwanya w''ingenzi ku iherezo ry''akazi karekare kadacitse ni igenzura ryahagaritse gukora mu bwiherero. Teganya ibyiciro bisaba byinshi aho guteganya impuzandengo: kugera, kugenda n''igikorwa cyose rusange akenshi bisaba abakozi benshi kurusha ibihe bihoraho, kandi gahunda yagenewe impuzandengo izabura abakozi neza mu twanya dufite akamaro. Aho umutungo uhari ari muke kurusha ibyo gahunda isaba, bibwire umukiriya mu buryo bugaragara aho kubyakira mu bwiherero, kuko ibikorwa bikorera munsi y''ibyo byasuzumye ari icyemezo umukiriya agomba gufata abizi.', 12, 3);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '80', 'Equipment Planning', 'Gutegura Ibikoresho', 'text', 'Equipment planning asks a single question for each item: will it be reachable and working at the moment it is needed. That question eliminates most of what is commonly carried and identifies what is commonly missing.

Plan: communications equipment and spares, charged and tested before deployment rather than assumed; medical equipment sized to be carried on the person or in the immediate vehicle rather than held centrally, because a trauma kit two hundred metres away is not a trauma kit; illumination; personal protective items appropriate to the environment; and documentation. Establish who carries what, so that responsibility is individual rather than collective — equipment assigned to the team is equipment nobody checks. Confirm compatibility, particularly of radios where multiple parties are operating. And plan the check: every item verified at the start of every deployment, because the assumption that equipment works fails precisely when it is being relied upon.', 'Gutegura ibikoresho kwibaza ikibazo kimwe kuri buri kintu: ese kizagerwaho kandi kikora mu kanya kikenewe. Icyo kibazo gikuraho ibyinshi mu bikunze gutwarwa kandi kimenya ibikunze kubura.

Teganya: ibikoresho by''itumanaho n''ibisimbura, byujuje amashanyarazi kandi byasuzumwe mbere yo gushyirwa ku murimo aho kwiyumvisha; ibikoresho bya muganga bingana ku buryo bitwarwa ku mubiri cyangwa mu modoka yegereye aho kubikwa hagati, kuko agasanduku k''ibikomere kari metero magana abiri kure atari agasanduku k''ibikomere; urumuri; ibintu bwite byo kwirinda bikwiye ahantu; n''inyandiko. Menya utwaye iki, kugira ngo inshingano ibe iy''umuntu aho kuba iy''itsinda — ibikoresho byahawe itsinda ni ibikoresho nta muntu ubigenzura. Emeza ko bihuye, cyane cyane radio aho impande nyinshi zikorera. Kandi uteganye igenzura: buri kintu kigenzurwa mu ntangiriro ya buri murimo, kuko kwiyumvisha ko ibikoresho bikora binanirwa neza igihe biringiwe.', 12, 4);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '81', 'Communication Planning', 'Gutegura Itumanaho', 'text', 'A communication plan defines how information moves during the engagement and, critically, what happens when the primary means fails. It states: the primary channel and the call signs; the secondary means and the trigger for switching to it; the escalation route — who reports to whom, at what threshold, and who is authorised to contact external services; the terminology for locations and phases so that traffic is meaningful to the team and not to a listener; and the check-in schedule where the detail is dispersed.

Test coverage during the advance at every point on the route and inside the venue, including basements, lifts, stairwells and any underground parking, because these are exactly the locations where coverage fails and exactly the locations where a detail becomes separated. Where a dead zone exists, plan around it rather than discovering it during an incident: a physical relay position, a defined rendezvous, or an agreement that a particular segment is conducted without communication and the team knows it.', 'Gahunda y''itumanaho igena uko amakuru agenda mu gihe cy''akazi kandi, cy''ingenzi, ibibaho igihe uburyo bw''ibanze bunaniranye. Ivuga: umurongo w''ibanze n''amazina; uburyo bwa kabiri n''ikimenyetso cyo guhindukira bukoreshwa; inzira yo kuzamura ikibazo — utangira raporo kuri nde, ku ruhe rwego, n''uwemerewe kuvugana n''inzego zo hanze; amagambo y''ahantu n''ibyiciro kugira ngo ubutumwa busobanuke ku itsinda kandi butasobanuka ku wumva; na gahunda yo kwitangaza aho itsinda ryatatanye.

Suzuma aho itumanaho rigera mu murimo ubanziriza ku hantu hose ku nzira no mu nyubako, harimo munsi y''ubutaka, mu itara, mu nzuriro n''aho imodoka zihagarara munsi y''ubutaka, kuko ari ho hantu itumanaho ridakora kandi ari ho itsinda ritandukanira. Aho itumanaho ridakora, teganya ubikurikije aho kubimenya mu gihe cy''ikibazo: umwanya w''umuntu wo kohereza ubutumwa, ahantu hagenwe ho guhurira, cyangwa ubwumvikane ko igice runaka kizakorwa nta tumanaho kandi itsinda rikabimenya.', 12, 5);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '82', 'Medical Support Planning', 'Gutegura Ubufasha bwa Muganga', 'text', 'Medical planning is proportionate to the risk and the environment, and it is the element most often underplanned relative to its likelihood, because a medical emergency affecting a principal is statistically far more probable than an attack.

Establish: the principal''s relevant medical history, medication and allergies, held securely and confidentially and known to the officers who would need it; the nearest appropriate facility for each point on the itinerary, confirmed as able to receive the relevant category of casualty rather than merely nearby; the journey time driven and recorded rather than estimated; the route to it, kept physically clear where practical; who in the detail holds a current first aid or trauma qualification and what they carry; the means of summoning emergency services and who does so; and the arrangement for informing the family. Where the environment or the principal''s own health warrants it, consider dedicated medical support as part of the detail rather than as an external arrangement.', 'Igenamigambi rya muganga rihuye n''ibyago n''ahantu, kandi ni cyo gice gikunze guteganywa nabi ugereranyije n''amahirwe yacyo, kuko ikibazo cya muganga kireba uwo barinda mu mibare gishoboka cyane kurusha igitero.

Menya: amateka ya muganga afite akamaro y''uwo barinda, imiti n''ubuvunanye, bibitswe neza kandi mu ibanga kandi bizwi n''abakozi bazabikenera; ivuriro rya hafi rikwiye kuri buri hantu kuri gahunda, ryemejwe ko rishobora kwakira ubwoko bw''uwakomeretse aho kuba iri hafi gusa; igihe urugendo rumara wagenze kandi cyanditse aho kugikeka; inzira igerayo, igumishwa ifunguye aho bishoboka; ni nde mu itsinda ufite icyemezo kigezweho cy''ubufasha bwa mbere cyangwa cy''ibikomere n''icyo atwaye; uburyo bwo guhamagara abatabazi n''ubikora; n''uburyo bwo kumenyesha umuryango. Aho ahantu cyangwa ubuzima bw''uwo barinda bibisaba, tekereza ubufasha bwa muganga bwihariye nk''igice cy''itsinda aho kubufata nk''ubwo hanze.', 12, 6);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '83', 'Emergency Response Planning', 'Gutegura Gutabara mu Byihutirwa', 'text', 'Emergency response planning converts the foreseeable scenarios into pre-decided actions, so that in the event nobody has to decide under pressure what a plan could have decided in advance. Plan for what is probable rather than what is dramatic: medical emergency, fire or building evacuation, vehicle breakdown or collision, separation of the detail from the principal, loss of communications, and a hostile incident.

For each, state: the trigger, the immediate action, who does what, where the principal goes, who is contacted and in what order, and how the incident is closed out. Keep the immediate actions short enough to be remembered without reference, because in an emergency nobody consults a document. Then rehearse the ones that matter — a plan that has been read is not a plan that has been rehearsed, and the difference between the two is measured in the seconds it takes a team to act without hesitation.', 'Gutegura gutabara mu byihutirwa bihindura ibishobora guteganywa ibikorwa byemejwe mbere, kugira ngo mu gihe kibaye nta muntu ugomba gufata icyemezo mu gitutu gahunda yashoboraga gufata mbere. Teganya ibishoboka aho guteganya ibikomeye: ikibazo cya muganga, inkongi cyangwa kwimuka mu nyubako, imodoka yapfuye cyangwa impanuka, gutandukana kw''itsinda n''uwo barinda, gutakaza itumanaho, n''ikibazo cy''urwango.

Kuri buri kimwe, vuga: ikimenyetso gitera, igikorwa cyihuse, ukora iki, uwo barinda ajya he, uhamagarwa n''urutonde, n''uko ikibazo gisozwa. Gumisha ibikorwa byihuse bigufi bihagije ku buryo byibukwa utarebye ikintu, kuko mu byihutirwa nta muntu ureba inyandiko. Hanyuma witoze ibifite akamaro — gahunda yasomwe si gahunda yitojwe, kandi itandukaniro riri hagati yazo ripimwa mu masegonda itsinda ritwara ryo gukora ritazuyaje.', 12, 7);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '84', 'Crisis Management Planning', 'Gutegura Gucunga Ikibazo Gikomeye', 'text', 'A crisis exceeds the capacity of the detail on the ground: it threatens the principal or the organisation in a way that requires decisions no standing procedure covers and resources the detail does not hold. Crisis planning establishes what is activated, by whom and at what trigger.

Define: the activation criteria, stated as conditions rather than judgements, so that a team does not spend the first fifteen minutes debating whether the situation qualifies; the crisis management team, identified by role rather than by individual so the structure survives absence; the authority each role holds, including who may commit expenditure, because a decision requiring a separate approval process will not be made in time; the communication cascade, including who informs the family and the client and in what order; the record-keeping requirement, since decisions taken under pressure with incomplete information will be examined afterwards with hindsight; and the specialist support arrangements for the scenarios — kidnap, serious injury, death — that the detail cannot manage alone.', 'Ikibazo gikomeye kirenga ubushobozi bw''itsinda riri ku murima: gihungabanya uwo barinda cyangwa ikigo mu buryo busaba ibyemezo nta nzira isanzwe ibikubiyemo n''umutungo itsinda ridafite. Gutegura ikibazo gikomeye bishyiraho ibishyirwa mu bikorwa, na nde n''ikimenyetso ki.

Gena: ibipimo byo gushyira mu bikorwa, bivuzwe nk''imimerere aho kuvugwa nk''ibyemezo, kugira ngo itsinda ritamare iminota cumi n''itanu ya mbere ripfa niba ikibazo cyujuje ibisabwa; itsinda ricunga ikibazo, rimenyekana ku murimo aho kumenyekana ku muntu kugira ngo imiterere ibeho hari udahari; ububasha buri murimo ufite, harimo ushobora kwemeza gukoresha amafaranga, kuko icyemezo gisaba inzira itandukanye yo kwemeza kitazafatwa ku gihe; urutonde rw''itumanaho, harimo umenyesha umuryango n''umukiriya n''urutonde; ibisabwa byo kubika inyandiko, kuko ibyemezo byafashwe mu gitutu hari amakuru atuzuye bizasuzumwa nyuma hamaze kumenyekana byose; n''uburyo bw''ubufasha bw''inzobere ku bibazo — gushimutwa, gukomereka bikomeye, urupfu — itsinda ridashobora gucunga ryonyine.', 12, 8);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '85', 'Evacuation Planning', 'Gutegura Kwimuka', 'text', 'Evacuation planning for a principal differs from general evacuation planning in one respect: the objective is not to leave with everyone else but to leave faster and by a different route, avoiding the crowd that general evacuation creates. That crowd is itself a hazard and, in a directed incident, potentially where a second threat waits.

Establish for every location: the emergency exits, not merely the entrance; the route from the principal''s likely position to each; the vehicle position and whether it can be reached directly; where the principal goes after leaving the building, which should be away from the assembly point rather than to it, since a principal standing in a car park among a crowd is exposed in a way the building never was; and who accounts for the detail. Rehearse the route physically during the advance rather than identifying it on a plan, because a route that looks viable on a floor plan may be locked, obstructed or lead somewhere unhelpful.', 'Gutegura kwimuka kw''uwo barinda gutandukanye no gutegura kwimuka rusange mu buryo bumwe: intego atari ugusohoka na buri wese ahubwo ni ugusohoka vuba kandi unyuze mu nzira itandukanye, wirinda imbaga kwimuka rusange gutanga. Iyo mbaga ubwayo ni akaga kandi, mu kibazo cyerekejwe, ishobora kuba ari ho iterabwoba rya kabiri ritegereje.

Menya kuri buri hantu: inzira zisohokerwa mu byihutirwa, atari urwinjiriro gusa; inzira iva aho uwo barinda ashobora kuba ari igana kuri buri imwe; aho imodoka iri n''ukuba ishobora kugerwaho mu buryo butaziguye; uwo barinda ajya he asohotse mu nyubako, hagomba kuba kure y''ahantu ho guhurira aho kuhajya, kuko uwo barinda uhagaze aho imodoka zihagarara mu mbaga agaragara mu buryo inyubako itigeze imugaragaza; n''ubarura itsinda. Itoze inzira mu buryo bw''umubiri mu murimo ubanziriza aho kuyimenya ku ikarita, kuko inzira igaragara ishoboka ku ikarita ishobora kuba ifunze, ibujijwe cyangwa igana ahantu hatagira akamaro.', 12, 9);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '86', 'Shelter-in-Place Planning', 'Gutegura Kuguma Aho Uri', 'text', 'Shelter-in-place is the correct response where moving would expose the principal to the threat rather than removing them from it: an external hazard, severe weather, civil disorder outside the building, or a security incident in which the exterior is less controlled than the interior. Choosing wrongly between evacuation and shelter is worse than acting slowly, which is why the plan must state in advance which threats call for which.

Plan the location: a room or area that can be secured, ideally with no external windows or with the ability to move away from them, with communications coverage, and reachable quickly from the principal''s likely positions. Establish what is held there — water, communications, medical supplies, a means of illumination — and for how long. Define who else is admitted and who is not. And define the trigger for ending it, because a shelter position held indefinitely without a decision point becomes a static and eventually known location.', 'Kuguma aho uri ni cyo gisubizo gikwiye aho kugenda byashyira uwo barinda ku kaga aho kumukuraho: akaga ko hanze, ikirere kibi cyane, akajagari ko hanze y''inyubako, cyangwa ikibazo cy''umutekano aho hanze hatagenzurwa kurusha imbere. Guhitamo nabi hagati yo kwimuka no kuguma aho ni bibi kurusha gukora buhoro, ni yo mpamvu gahunda igomba kuvuga mbere iterabwoba risaba iki.

Teganya ahantu: icyumba cyangwa agace gashobora kurindwa, byaba byiza kadafite amadirishya yerekeye hanze cyangwa gafite ubushobozi bwo kuyava kure, gafite itumanaho, kandi kagerwaho vuba uvuye aho uwo barinda ashobora kuba ari. Menya ibibikwa aho — amazi, itumanaho, ibikoresho bya muganga, uburyo bwo kumurika — n''igihe kingana iki. Gena undi wemererwa kwinjira n''utemererwa. Kandi ugene ikimenyetso cyo kubisoza, kuko umwanya wo kuguma aho ugumishwa nta gihe ntarengwa nta hantu ho gufata icyemezo uhinduka ahantu hahoraho kandi amaherezo hamenyekana.', 12, 10);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '87', 'Contingency Planning', 'Gutegura Ibitunguranye', 'text', 'Contingency planning addresses the disruptions that are predictable enough that improvising them is a failure of planning rather than bad luck. The recurring ones are: a schedule change or addition at short notice; a delayed or cancelled flight; a venue change; a route blocked by works, an accident or a demonstration; a vehicle breakdown; loss of communications; an officer unavailable; a weather event; and the principal departing from the plan, which is common and must be planned for rather than resented.

For each, state the trigger, the response, who decides and what the fallback is. The most valuable contingency planning addresses the last item on that list: a principal who decides to walk somewhere unplanned, accept an unscheduled invitation or leave earlier than agreed is not an aberration but a normal feature of the work, and a detail that has thought about it in advance responds smoothly while one that has not either obstructs the principal or abandons the plan entirely.', 'Gutegura ibitunguranye bicyuha ibibazo biteganywa bihagije ku buryo kubikorera mu kanya ari ikosa ry''igenamigambi aho kuba amahirwe mabi. Ibisubirwamo ni: impinduka cyangwa inyongera kuri gahunda mu gihe gito; indege yatinze cyangwa yahagaritswe; guhinduka kw''ahantu; inzira ibujijwe n''imirimo, impanuka cyangwa imyigaragambyo; imodoka yapfuye; gutakaza itumanaho; umukozi udahari; ikirere; n''uwo barinda uva kuri gahunda, bikunze kubaho kandi bigomba guteganywa aho kubirakarira.

Kuri buri kimwe, vuga ikimenyetso gitera, igisubizo, ufata icyemezo n''icyakoreshwa. Gutegura ibitunguranye gufite agaciro kanini gucyuha ikintu cya nyuma kuri urwo rutonde: uwo barinda ufata icyemezo cyo kugenda ahantu hatateganyijwe, kwemera ubutumire butateganyijwe cyangwa kugenda mbere y''igihe cyumvikanyweho ntabwo ari ikintu kidasanzwe ahubwo ni ikintu gisanzwe muri uyu murimo, kandi itsinda ryabitekerejeho mbere risubiza neza mu gihe ritabikoze ribangamira uwo barinda cyangwa rikareka gahunda burundu.', 12, 11);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V4_3, '88', 'Incident Management Plans', 'Gahunda zo Gucunga Ibibazo', 'text', 'An incident management plan sets out how an incident is run from the first indication to the formal close, and it exists so that the response is structured rather than improvised. It states: who takes command and who deputises, identified by position; the sequence of immediate priorities, which is always protect life, contain, notify; the communication arrangement during the incident, including who speaks to whom and who does not speak at all; the point at which command transfers to an emergency service and what the detail''s role becomes afterwards, which is support rather than continued direction; the record-keeping requirement, including who logs decisions and times; the notification sequence for the client and the family; and the criteria for formally closing the incident.

The most common failure in incident management is ambiguity about who is in command, because officers unsure of the chain wait for permission nobody is issuing. Name the role rather than the person, brief it before every engagement, and confirm that every officer can state who commands and who deputises without being prompted.', 'Gahunda yo gucunga ikibazo ishyiraho uko ikibazo gicungwa uhereye ku kimenyetso cya mbere ukageza ku gusoza ku mugaragaro, kandi ibaho kugira ngo igisubizo kibe giteguye aho kuba icyikorerwe mu kanya. Ivuga: ufata ubuyobozi n''umusimbura, bamenyekana ku mwanya; urutonde rw''ibyihutirwa by''ibanze, buri gihe ari ugukurinda ubuzima, kugarura, gutangaza; uburyo bw''itumanaho mu gihe cy''ikibazo, harimo uvugana na nde n''utavuga na gato; akanya ubuyobozi bwimurirwa ku rwego rw''abatabazi n''icyo uruhare rw''itsinda ruba nyuma, ari ugushyigikira aho gukomeza kuyobora; ibisabwa byo kubika inyandiko, harimo wandika ibyemezo n''amasaha; urutonde rwo kumenyesha umukiriya n''umuryango; n''ibipimo byo gusoza ikibazo ku mugaragaro.

Ikosa rikunze kubaho mu gucunga ikibazo ni kutamenya ufite ubuyobozi, kuko abakozi batazi urutonde bategereza uruhushya nta muntu urutanga. Gena umurimo aho kugena umuntu, umenyeshe mbere ya buri kazi, kandi wemeze ko buri mukozi ashobora kuvuga uyobora n''umusimbura atabajijwe.', 12, 12);
  insert into public.assessments (course_id, module_id, title, title_rw, kind, pass_mark, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V4', m_EP_V4_3, 'Quiz — Resources, Contingency and Emergency Planning', 'Ikizamini — Umutungo, Ibitunguranye n''Igenamigambi ry''Ibyihutirwa', 'quiz', 70, 3)
