-- ---------- EP-V7 · Executive Protection — Volume 7: Business & Administrative ----------
do $$ declare m_EP_V7_1 uuid; a_id uuid; q_id uuid; begin
  if not exists (select 1 from public.courses where id = 'EP-V7') then return; end if;
  insert into public.modules (course_id, number, title, title_rw, intro, intro_rw, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V7', 1, 'Establishing and Running a Protective Services Business', 'Gushinga no Kuyobora Ubucuruzi bwa Serivisi zo Kurinda', 'Subjects 163–170. This module covers starting a company, security business management, business ethics, client management, proposals, contracts, pricing and budget management.', 'Ingingo 163–170. Iki gice kigaruka ku gushinga ikigo, imicungire y''ubucuruzi bw''umutekano, ubunyangamugayo mu bucuruzi, gucunga abakiriya, gutanga ibyifuzo, amasezerano, gushyiraho ibiciro n''imicungire y''ingengo y''imari.', 1)
  returning id into m_EP_V7_1;
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '163', 'Starting an Executive Protection Company', 'Gushinga Ikigo Cyo Kurinda Abakomeye', 'text', 'Most protective professionals who start a company do so because they are good at the work, and most of those who fail do so because being good at the work is roughly a third of what a company requires. Before anything else, establish the regulatory position: whether protective services require a licence in your jurisdiction, what the conditions attaching to it are, whether individual officers require separate licensing, and what insurance is mandatory. Operating without a required licence is not a technical breach — it typically voids insurance, invalidates contracts and constitutes an offence.

Then establish the commercial basics honestly. Working capital sufficient to pay officers before the client pays you, because payment terms in this sector are long and an operation that cannot bridge them fails regardless of demand. A realistic assessment of what you can actually deliver with the people you actually have. A pricing model that covers the costs most new companies omit — insurance, training, equipment replacement, advance work, administration and the officer time that is paid but not billable. And a clear statement of what you will not take on, because the assignments that destroy small companies are almost always the ones accepted beyond capability.', 'Abanyamwuga benshi bo kurinda batangiza ikigo babikora kuko ari beza mu murimo, kandi benshi mu bananirwa babikora kuko kuba mwiza mu murimo ari hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy''ibyo ikigo gisaba. Mbere y''ikindi cyose, menya umwanya mu mategeko: niba serivisi zo kurinda zisaba uruhushya aho ukorera, ibisabwa bijyanye na rwo, niba abakozi ku giti cyabo basaba impushya zitandukanye, n''ubwishingizi buba ngombwa. Gukora nta ruhushya rusabwa ntabwo ari ikosa ry''ikoranabuhanga — akenshi bikuraho ubwishingizi, bigatesha agaciro amasezerano kandi bikaba icyaha.

Hanyuma umenye ishingiro ry''ubucuruzi mu bunyakuri. Amafaranga y''akazi ahagije yo kwishyura abakozi mbere y''uko umukiriya akwishyura, kuko ibisabwa mu kwishyura muri uru rwego biba birebire kandi ibikorwa bidashobora kubyihanganira biranirwa uko ibisabwa byaba byinshi kose. Isuzuma ryihanganye ry''ibyo ushobora gutanga koko n''abantu ufite koko. Uburyo bwo gushyiraho ibiciro bupfukirana ikiguzi ibigo bishya byinshi bisiga — ubwishingizi, amahugurwa, gusimbura ibikoresho, umurimo ubanziriza, imicungire n''igihe cy''umukozi cyishyurwa kitishyurwa n''umukiriya.', 12, 1);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '164', 'Security Business Management', 'Imicungire y''Ubucuruzi bw''Umutekano', 'text', 'A protective services business is a people business in which the product is capability, and the management task is to hold that capability available at a cost the market will pay. The recurring tensions are structural rather than incidental. Utilisation: officers who are not deployed cost money and officers who are always deployed become fatigued and leave, and a business that solves this by staffing to peak demand cannot price competitively while one that staffs to average demand cannot deliver at peak. Cash flow: payment terms are long, payroll is not, and a profitable business can fail on timing alone. Quality control: the work happens away from the office, which means the manager cannot observe it and must build systems that reveal what is actually happening rather than what is reported.

The systems that matter most are unglamorous: a rota that accounts for relief and rest, a scheduling process that does not depend on one person''s memory, a documented standard for each assignment type, a route by which an officer can raise a problem without going through the person causing it, and an audit that verifies delivery rather than trusting the invoice.', 'Ubucuruzi bwa serivisi zo kurinda ni ubucuruzi bw''abantu aho igicuruzwa ari ubushobozi, kandi umurimo w''imicungire ni ukugumisha ubwo bushobozi buhari ku giciro isoko rizishyura. Amakimbirane asubirwamo ni ay''imiterere aho kuba ay''amahirwe. Gukoreshwa: abakozi batashyizwe ku murimo batwara amafaranga kandi abakozi bahora ku murimo baranagirwa bakagenda, kandi ubucuruzi bukemura ibi bushyiraho abakozi bahagije ibisabwa byinshi ntibushobora gushyiraho ibiciro bihatana mu gihe bushyiraho abakozi b''impuzandengo butashobora gutanga ibisabwa biri hejuru. Igenda ry''amafaranga: ibisabwa mu kwishyura biba birebire, imishahara ntibirebire, kandi ubucuruzi bwungutse bushobora kunanirwa ku gihe gusa. Kugenzura ubwiza: umurimo ubera kure y''ibiro, bivuze ko umuyobozi adashobora kuwitegereza akagomba kubaka sisitemu zigaragaza ibibaho koko aho kugaragaza ibitangwaho raporo.

Sisitemu zifite akamaro kurusha izindi ntizigaragara: urutonde rw''akazi rubarirwamo gusimburana no kuruhuka, inzira yo gutegura akazi itashingira ku kwibuka kw''umuntu umwe, urwego rwanditse kuri buri bwoko bw''akazi, inzira umukozi ashobora kuvugiraho ikibazo atanyuze ku muntu ugitera, n''igenzura ryemeza ko byatanzwe aho kwizera inyemezabwishyu.', 12, 2);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '165', 'Business Ethics', 'Ubunyangamugayo mu Bucuruzi', 'text', 'Commercial pressure in this sector produces a small number of recurring ethical failures, and each is more damaging to a business than the revenue it was meant to protect. Overstating capability to win work — claiming certifications, experience or capacity the organisation does not hold — is discovered on the first demanding assignment and ends the client relationship and the reputation together. Deploying officers who lack the required qualification because the assignment is starting tomorrow transfers the risk to the principal and is indefensible afterwards. Under-resourcing an assignment relative to what was assessed, without telling the client, converts a professional judgement into a concealed decision the client would not have made.

The positive obligations matter equally: tell a client something they do not want to hear when the assessment requires it; decline an assignment beyond your capability and say why; disclose a conflict of interest; and never accept a payment or benefit from any party seeking access to or information about a principal. In a sector where reputation is the only marketing that matters, the ethical position and the commercial one point in the same direction more often than commercial pressure makes it feel.', 'Igitutu cy''ubucuruzi muri uru rwego gitanga amakosa make y''ubunyangamugayo asubirwamo, kandi buri rimwe ryangiza ubucuruzi kurusha amafaranga ryari rigamije kurinda. Kwivuga ubushobozi burenze ubwo ufite kugira ngo ubone akazi — kwivuga ibyemezo, uburambe cyangwa ubushobozi ikigo kidafite — bimenyekana ku kazi ka mbere gasaba byinshi kandi birangiza umubano n''umukiriya n''ishusho hamwe. Gushyira ku murimo abakozi badafite icyemezo gisabwa kuko akazi gatangira ejo bwohereza ibyago ku wo barinda kandi ntibishobora kwiregurwa nyuma. Gushyira akazi umutungo muke ugereranyije n''ibyasuzumwe, utabibwiye umukiriya, bihindura icyemezo cy''umwuga icyemezo cyihishe umukiriya atari gufata.

Inshingano nziza na zo zifite akamaro: bwira umukiriya ikintu adashaka kumva igihe isuzuma ribisaba; wange akazi karenze ubushobozi bwawe uvuge impamvu; tangaza inyungu zinyuranye; kandi ntukigere wakira ubwishyu cyangwa inyungu ku ruhande rwose rushaka kwinjira ku wo barinda cyangwa amakuru kuri we.', 12, 3);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '166', 'Client Management', 'Gucunga Abakiriya', 'text', 'The client and the principal are frequently not the same person, and managing the relationship means managing both. The client — a company, a family office, a chief of staff — holds the contract, decides the budget and receives the reporting. The principal experiences the service and forms the view that determines whether it continues. A detail that satisfies the principal but never communicates with the client is at risk at every renewal; one that reports impressively to the client while the principal finds the arrangement intrusive is at greater risk still, because the principal will simply begin travelling without the team.

Manage the client relationship with regular structured reporting that leads with what has changed rather than restating what is stable, states risk in terms of exposure and consequence rather than in security language, and never conceals a problem in the hope of resolving it first. Manage the principal relationship through discretion, reliability and explanation rather than instruction. And establish early who decides what: a detail receiving conflicting direction from a client and a principal must know in advance whose instruction governs.', 'Umukiriya n''uwo barinda akenshi ntabwo ari umuntu umwe, kandi gucunga umubano bisobanura gucunga bombi. Umukiriya — ikigo, ibiro by''umuryango, umuyobozi w''abakozi — afite amasezerano, agena ingengo y''imari kandi yakira raporo. Uwo barinda ni we wumva serivisi kandi agafata igitekerezo kigena niba izakomeza. Itsinda rinyura uwo barinda ariko ritigera rivugana n''umukiriya riri mu kaga kuri buri kongera amasezerano; irikora raporo nziza ku mukiriya mu gihe uwo barinda abona ko uburyo bumubangamira riri mu kaga kanini kurushaho, kuko uwo barinda azahita atangira kugenda atajyanye n''itsinda.

Cunga umubano n''umukiriya ukoresheje raporo zihoraho ziteguye zitangirira ku byahindutse aho gusubiramo ibihamye, zivuga ibyago mu buryo bw''ibigaragara n''ingaruka aho kubivuga mu rurimi rw''umutekano, kandi zitigera zihisha ikibazo wiringiye kubanza kugikemura. Cunga umubano n''uwo barinda ukoresheje ubushishozi, kwizerwa no gusobanura aho gukoresha itegeko. Kandi ushyireho hakiri kare ugena iki: itsinda ryakira amabwiriza avuguruzanya ava ku mukiriya n''uwo barinda rigomba kumenya mbere iryo ryemewe.', 12, 4);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '167', 'Proposal Writing', 'Kwandika Ibyifuzo', 'text', 'A proposal is an assessment presented commercially, and the ones that win are those that demonstrate understanding of the client''s actual exposure rather than those that list the provider''s capabilities. Lead with what you understand about their situation, since a proposal that opens with the provider''s history tells the reader nothing about themselves. State the exposure specifically — the routine that is predictable, the information that is publicly available, the location where control is weakest — because a client who recognises their own situation in your analysis will trust the recommendation that follows.

Then state what you propose, what it addresses, what it costs and what is excluded. Be explicit about exclusions, since a proposal that describes what will be provided without describing what will not invites an expectation that was never priced and produces a dispute later. Price honestly rather than to win: an underpriced proposal that is accepted becomes an under-resourced assignment, which is worse for the client, the principal and the provider than not winning it. And never propose a capability you do not hold on the assumption that you will arrange it if the work is awarded.', 'Icyifuzo ni isuzuma ritanzwe mu bucuruzi, kandi ibitsinda ni ibigaragaza gusobanukirwa ibyago nyabyo by''umukiriya aho kuba ibitondeka ubushobozi bw''utanga serivisi. Tangirira ku byo usobanukiwe ku mimerere ye, kuko icyifuzo gitangirira ku mateka y''utanga serivisi nta cyo kibwira umusomyi kuri we. Vuga ibigaragara byihariye — ibisanzwe biteganywa, amakuru aboneka ku mugaragaro, ahantu igenzura ridakomeye — kuko umukiriya wibona mu isesengura ryawe azizera icyifuzo gikurikira.

Hanyuma uvuge icyo utanga, icyo gikemura, ikiguzi cyacyo n''ibitarimo. Vuga neza ibitarimo, kuko icyifuzo gisobanura ibizatangwa kitasobanura ibitazatangwa gitumira icyitegererezo kitigeze gihabwa igiciro kandi gitanga amakimbirane nyuma. Shyiraho igiciro mu bunyakuri aho kugishyiraho kugira ngo utsinde: icyifuzo gifite igiciro gito cyemewe kiba akazi gafite umutungo muke, ari bibi ku mukiriya, ku wo barinda no ku utanga serivisi kurusha kutagatsinda. Kandi ntukigere utanga ubushobozi udafite wiyumvisha ko uzabutegura akazi kamaze guhabwa.', 12, 5);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '168', 'Security Contracts', 'Amasezerano y''Umutekano', 'text', 'A protective services contract should be specific enough that both parties would agree, a year later and after a dispute, on what was included. State: the scope, described by what will be delivered rather than by capability language; the number of officers, hours, locations and any variation arrangement; what is expressly excluded; the rate structure including overtime, travel, expenses and short-notice work; payment terms and the consequences of late payment; liability allocation and the insurance each party holds and maintains; confidentiality obligations and their duration, which survive termination; the standard of service and how it is measured; the notice period and termination provisions; and the governing law and jurisdiction.

Two provisions repay disproportionate attention. The variation clause, because assignments always change and a contract without a mechanism for pricing a change produces either unpaid work or a dispute. And the termination provision, because a protective engagement that ends badly and abruptly leaves a principal unprotected, which is a safety question as well as a commercial one and should be handled with a notice period long enough to transition.', 'Amasezerano ya serivisi zo kurinda agomba kuba ayihariye bihagije ku buryo impande zombi zakwemeranya, nyuma y''umwaka kandi nyuma y''amakimbirane, ku byari birimo. Vuga: ibyo serivisi ikubiyemo, bisobanuwe n''ibizatangwa aho kubisobanura mu magambo y''ubushobozi; umubare w''abakozi, amasaha, ahantu n''uburyo bwo guhindura; ibitarimo mu buryo bugaragara; imiterere y''igiciro harimo amasaha y''inyongera, urugendo, amafaranga akoreshwa n''akazi gasabwa mu gihe gito; ibisabwa mu kwishyura n''ingaruka zo kwishyura bitinze; kugabana inshingano n''ubwishingizi buri ruhande rufite kandi rubungabunga; inshingano z''ibanga n''igihe zimara, zikomeza nyuma yo gusesa; urwego rwa serivisi n''uko rupimwa; igihe cyo kumenyesha n''ingingo zo gusesa; n''amategeko agenga n''aho urubanza ruberera.

Ingingo ebyiri zisaba ubwitonzi burenze. Ingingo yo guhindura, kuko akazi buri gihe kahinduka kandi amasezerano adafite uburyo bwo gushyiraho igiciro cy''impinduka atanga umurimo utishyurwa cyangwa amakimbirane. N''ingingo yo gusesa, kuko akazi ko kurinda karangiye nabi kandi mu buryo butunguranye gasiga uwo barinda atarinzwe.', 12, 6);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '169', 'Pricing Security Services', 'Gushyiraho Ibiciro bya Serivisi z''Umutekano', 'text', 'Pricing failure is the most common cause of failure in small protective businesses, and it is almost always the same failure: pricing from the officer''s hourly cost rather than from the full cost of delivering the service. The costs routinely omitted are: employer contributions and statutory costs; insurance including professional indemnity; training and requalification, which is continuous rather than one-off; equipment purchase and replacement cycles; vehicle costs where applicable; the advance work, which is real labour producing no billable hour; briefing, reporting and administration time; the cost of relief and cover for leave and sickness; and the officer time that is paid but not deployed, which is unavoidable in any business that must hold capability available.

Price the assignment rather than the hour, and present the price with what it delivers rather than as a rate to be compared. Where a client requests a reduction, reduce the scope rather than the price — a service delivered below the assessed requirement at a reduced rate is an under-resourced assignment that the provider will be answerable for, and reducing scope makes the decision the client''s rather than the provider''s.', 'Kunanirwa mu gushyiraho ibiciro ni yo mpamvu ikunze gutera kunanirwa mu bucuruzi buto bwo kurinda, kandi hafi buri gihe ni kunanirwa kumwe: gushyiraho igiciro uhereye ku kiguzi cy''isaha cy''umukozi aho kugishyiraho uhereye ku kiguzi cyose cyo gutanga serivisi. Ikiguzi gisanzwe gisigwa ni: imisanzu y''umukoresha n''ikiguzi cy''amategeko; ubwishingizi harimo ubw''umwuga; amahugurwa no kongera kwemezwa, bikomeza aho kuba rimwe; kugura no gusimbura ibikoresho; ikiguzi cy''imodoka aho bikoreshwa; umurimo ubanziriza, ari umurimo nyawo utanga isaha itishyurwa; igihe cyo kumenyesha, gutanga raporo n''imicungire; ikiguzi cyo gusimburana no gupfukirana ikiruhuko n''uburwayi; n''igihe cy''umukozi cyishyurwa atashyizwe ku murimo.

Shyiraho igiciro cy''akazi aho gushyiraho icy''isaha, kandi utange igiciro n''ibyo gitanga aho kugitanga nk''igipimo cyo kugereranywa. Aho umukiriya asaba kugabanuka, gabanya ibyo serivisi ikubiyemo aho kugabanya igiciro.', 12, 7);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V7_1, '170', 'Budget Management', 'Imicungire y''Ingengo y''Imari', 'text', 'Budget management in this sector is the discipline of holding capability available within a cost the client will pay, and it fails in predictable places. Build the budget from the assessment rather than from last year''s figure adjusted, and present each line with the risk it addresses and the operational consequence of removing it — a budget presented as a total invites a percentage cut, while one presented as a set of risk decisions invites a decision on each line.

Monitor against the budget continuously rather than at period end, because the overruns in protective work are cumulative and small: an extra officer on a few assignments, overtime absorbed rather than billed, travel and expenses not recovered, advance work performed and not charged. Each is individually reasonable and collectively fatal to a margin. Where the client declines a line, record what has been accepted and by whom, because an operation running below its own assessed requirement is a decision the client should make knowingly and a record the provider will need if an incident follows.', 'Imicungire y''ingengo y''imari muri uru rwego ni umurava wo kugumisha ubushobozi buhari mu kiguzi umukiriya azishyura, kandi inanirwa mu hantu hateganywa. Ubaka ingengo y''imari uhereye ku isuzuma aho kuyubaka uhereye ku mubare w''umwaka ushize wahinduwe, kandi utange buri murongo hamwe n''ikibazo ukemura n''ingaruka ku bikorwa zo kuwukuraho — ingengo y''imari itangwa nk''igiteranyo itumira gucibwa ku ijanisha, mu gihe itangwa nk''ihuriro ry''ibyemezo by''ibyago itumira icyemezo kuri buri murongo.

Kurikirana ugereranyije n''ingengo y''imari buhoraho aho kubikora ku iherezo ry''igihe, kuko kurenza mu murimo wo kurinda kwiyongera kandi ni guke: umukozi w''inyongera ku kazi gake, amasaha y''inyongera yakiriwe atishyuzwe, urugendo n''amafaranga akoreshwa atagaruwe, umurimo ubanziriza wakozwe utishyuzwe. Buri kimwe ku giti cyacyo gishyize mu gaciro kandi hamwe bica inyungu. Aho umukiriya yanze umurongo, andika icyemewe n''uwacyemeye.', 12, 8);
  insert into public.assessments (course_id, module_id, title, title_rw, kind, pass_mark, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V7', m_EP_V7_1, 'Quiz — Establishing and Running a Protective Services Business', 'Ikizamini — Gushinga no Kuyobora Ubucuruzi bwa Serivisi zo Kurinda', 'quiz', 70, 1)
