-- ---------- EP-V8 · Executive Protection — Volume 8: EP Leadership ----------
do $$ declare m_EP_V8_1 uuid; a_id uuid; q_id uuid; begin
  if not exists (select 1 from public.courses where id = 'EP-V8') then return; end if;
  insert into public.modules (course_id, number, title, title_rw, intro, intro_rw, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V8', 1, 'Leading a Protective Detail', 'Kuyobora Itsinda Ririnda', 'Subjects 178–183. This module covers leadership principles in protection, team leadership, the detail commander''s role, decision-making under stress, crisis leadership and communication leadership.', 'Ingingo 178–183. Iki gice kigaruka ku mahame y''ubuyobozi mu kurinda, ubuyobozi bw''itsinda, umurimo w''umuyobozi w''itsinda, gufata ibyemezo mu gitutu, ubuyobozi mu bihe by''ikibazo n''ubuyobozi mu itumanaho.', 1)
  returning id into m_EP_V8_1;
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '178', 'Leadership Principles in Protection', 'Amahame y''Ubuyobozi mu Kurinda', 'text', 'Leadership in protective work differs from leadership in most other settings in one respect that shapes everything else: the leader is frequently physically present in the situation they are directing, and must therefore hold the whole picture while being inside part of it. That is the characteristic difficulty, and the characteristic failure follows directly from it — a commander who becomes absorbed in performing a task personally has stopped commanding, and the operation loses direction at precisely the moment direction is the scarcest resource available.

The principles that hold across this discipline are few. Lead by the standard you enforce, because a team calibrates against what the leader does rather than what they say. Make the decision that is yours to make and delegate the rest, since a leader who decides everything creates a team that decides nothing and cannot function when they are absent. Be visibly composed, because a detail reads its leader''s demeanour as information about how serious the situation is. And protect the reporting culture above almost everything, since a leader who receives only good news is leading an operation they cannot see.', 'Ubuyobozi mu murimo wo kurinda butandukanye n''ubuyobozi mu hantu handi henshi mu buryo bumwe bugena ibindi byose: umuyobozi akenshi aba ahari mu buryo bw''umubiri mu mimerere ari kuyobora, bityo agomba kugumana ishusho yose mu gihe ari imbere mu gice cyayo. Ni yo ngorane yihariye, kandi ikosa ryihariye rikurikira ako kanya — umuyobozi wibanda ku gukora umurimo ku giti cye aba yahagaritse kuyobora, kandi ibikorwa bigatakaza icyerekezo neza mu kanya icyerekezo ari cyo kintu kibura kurusha ibindi.

Amahame ahamye muri uyu mwuga ni make. Yobora ukurikije urwego ukurikiza, kuko itsinda ripima ku byo umuyobozi akora aho gupima ku byo avuga. Fata icyemezo cyawe ugahereza ibindi abandi, kuko umuyobozi ufata ibyemezo byose akora itsinda ridafata icyemezo na kimwe kandi ridashobora gukora adahari. Ba utuje bigaragara, kuko itsinda risoma imyifatire y''umuyobozi waryo nk''amakuru ku buremere bw''ibintu. Kandi rinda umuco wo gutanga raporo kurusha hafi ibindi byose, kuko umuyobozi wakira amakuru meza gusa ayobora ibikorwa adashobora kubona.', 12, 1);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '179', 'Team Leadership', 'Ubuyobozi bw''Itsinda', 'text', 'A protective detail is a small team performing continuous work under conditions that erode standards quietly: long uneventful periods, fatigue, and an environment where nobody senior is watching most of the time. Team leadership in this setting is largely about what happens when the leader is not present, which means it is built in advance rather than exercised in the moment.

The practical elements are: a clear allocation of roles so that every officer knows what they are responsible for and what others will do; a briefing standard applied every time so that shared understanding is not assumed; visible consistency in applying standards, including to the most senior member of the team, since a standard waived once for anyone is a standard the team now regards as optional; and a reporting route that works without the leader — an officer who can only raise a problem through the person causing it will not raise it. Invest in the officers who will still be there in two years rather than only in the current assignment, because in a sector with high turnover, retention is a capability rather than a personnel statistic.', 'Itsinda ririnda ni itsinda rito rikora umurimo ukomeza mu bihe byangiza urwego mu bwiherero: ibihe birebire nta kibaho, umunaniro, n''ahantu nta mukuru ureba mu bihe byinshi. Ubuyobozi bw''itsinda muri aha hantu cyane cyane bireba ibibaho igihe umuyobozi adahari, bivuze ko bwubakwa mbere aho gukoreshwa mu kanya.

Ibice bifatika ni: guhereza imirimo neza kugira ngo buri mukozi amenye icyo ashinzwe n''icyo abandi bazakora; urwego rwo kumenyesha rukoreshwa buri gihe kugira ngo gusobanukirwa gusangiwe kutiyumvishwa; guhoraho kugaragara mu gukurikiza urwego, harimo no ku mukozi mukuru kurusha abandi mu itsinda, kuko urwego rwarengagijwe rimwe ku muntu uwo ari we wese ari urwego itsinda ubu ribona nk''uruhitamo; n''inzira yo gutanga raporo ikora umuyobozi adahari — umukozi ushobora kuvuga ikibazo gusa anyuze ku muntu ugitera ntazakivuga. Shora mu bakozi bazaba bakiriho mu myaka ibiri aho gushora gusa mu kazi kariho, kuko mu rwego rufite guhinduranya kwinshi, kugumana abakozi ari ubushobozi aho kuba umubare gusa.', 12, 2);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '180', 'The Protective Detail Commander', 'Umuyobozi w''Itsinda Ririnda', 'text', 'The detail commander is accountable for the plan, the briefing, the decisions taken during the engagement and the review afterwards. That accountability is personal and does not transfer: an inadequate advance conducted by another officer, a briefing that omitted something, or an unassigned role that produced hesitation are all the commander''s responsibility regardless of who performed the task.

The role is defined by what only the commander can do. Hold the whole picture, which is why the commander should not be the officer working the principal — those two functions require opposite actions at the same moment and cannot be held by one person during an incident. Make the decisions that are reserved: to proceed, to vary, to abort, to evacuate, to escalate, to hand over to an emergency service. Allocate tasks and confirm they were understood rather than issued. Control the flow of information so that the team has what it needs and the client has what they need, which are not the same thing. And be the person the team can raise a problem with, because a commander who is difficult to approach receives an operational picture that is systematically better than reality.', 'Umuyobozi w''itsinda abazwa gahunda, kumenyesha, ibyemezo byafashwe mu gihe cy''akazi n''isuzuma nyuma. Ubwo kubazwa ni ubwe kandi ntibwimurwa: umurimo ubanziriza udahagije wakozwe n''undi mukozi, kumenyesha kwasize ikintu, cyangwa umurimo utahawe umuntu watanze gutinda byose ni inshingano y''umuyobozi uko uwakoze umurimo yaba ari we wese.

Umurimo usobanurwa n''ibyo umuyobozi wenyine ashobora gukora. Kugumana ishusho yose, ni yo mpamvu umuyobozi atagomba kuba umukozi ukorera uwo barinda — iyo mirimo ibiri isaba ibikorwa bihabanye mu kanya kamwe kandi ntishobora kuba ku muntu umwe mu gihe cy''ikibazo. Gufata ibyemezo byabitswe: gukomeza, guhindura, guhagarika, kwimura, kuzamura ikibazo, guhererekanya ku rwego rw''abatabazi. Guhereza imirimo no kwemeza ko yumvikanye aho kwemeza ko yatanzwe. Kugenzura uko amakuru agenda kugira ngo itsinda ribone ibyo rikeneye n''umukiriya abone ibyo akeneye, bitari kimwe. No kuba umuntu itsinda rishobora kuvugana na we ku kibazo.', 12, 3);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '181', 'Decision-Making Under Stress', 'Gufata Ibyemezo mu Gitutu', 'text', 'Decision-making degrades under acute stress in predictable and well-documented ways: attention narrows so that peripheral information is not processed, time perception distorts so that events feel faster or slower than they are, working memory contracts so that complex sequences cannot be held, and the tendency to default to the most familiar action rises sharply regardless of whether it fits the situation. None of this is a failure of character and none of it can be overcome by resolve.

What it can be overcome by is preparation. A decision already made in the operations order does not have to be made under stress — which is the entire operational purpose of planning in advance and the reason immediate action drills exist. Reduce the number of decisions the moment requires: pre-decide the abort criteria, the immediate actions, the escalation thresholds and the rendezvous point. Then, in the moment, do three things: state the situation aloud, which forces structure onto perception; make the decision that is yours and delegate the rest; and act, because in most protective incidents a prompt adequate decision outperforms a delayed optimal one.', 'Gufata ibyemezo birangirika mu gitutu gikaze mu buryo buteganywa kandi bwanditse neza: ubwitonzi buragabanuka ku buryo amakuru y''iruhande adatunganywa, kumva igihe birahinduka ku buryo ibintu bigaragara byihuta cyangwa bitinda kurusha uko biri, kwibuka gukora kuragabanuka ku buryo urutonde rugoye rudashobora kugumanwa, kandi umuco wo gusubira ku gikorwa kimenyerewe kurusha ibindi wiyongera cyane utitaye ku kuba gihuye n''imimerere. Nta na kimwe muri ibi ari ikosa ry''imico kandi nta na kimwe gishobora gutsindwa n''ubushake.

Icyo bishobora gutsindwa na cyo ni ugutegura. Icyemezo kimaze gufatwa mu mabwiriza y''igikorwa ntikigomba gufatwa mu gitutu — ari yo ntego yose y''akazi yo gutegura mbere n''impamvu imyitozo y''ibikorwa byihuse ibaho. Gabanya umubare w''ibyemezo ako kanya gasaba: fata mbere ibipimo byo guhagarika, ibikorwa byihuse, inzego zo kuzamura ikibazo n''ahantu ho guhurira. Hanyuma, muri ako kanya, kora ibintu bitatu: vuga uko ibintu bimeze mu ijwi riranguruye, bihatira imiterere ku byo ubona; fata icyemezo cyawe uhereze ibindi abandi; kandi ukore, kuko mu bibazo byinshi byo kurinda icyemezo cyihuse gihagije kiruta icyiza gitinze.', 12, 4);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '182', 'Crisis Leadership', 'Ubuyobozi mu Bihe by''Ikibazo', 'text', 'A crisis exceeds normal operational capacity and therefore requires a different structure to be activated rather than the existing one working harder. Crisis leadership begins before the crisis: defining the activation criteria as conditions rather than judgements, so that a team does not spend the first fifteen minutes debating whether the situation qualifies; identifying the crisis team by role rather than by individual so the structure survives absence; and establishing who may commit expenditure, because a decision requiring a separate approval process will not be made in time.

During the crisis the leader''s tasks are: establish and hold the situation picture, which will be incomplete and must be acted on anyway; make the decisions that are reserved and delegate the rest visibly; control communication, including the obligation to inform the family and the client accurately and before they hear it elsewhere; and ensure every decision and its reasoning is recorded, because decisions taken with incomplete information under time pressure will be examined afterwards with the benefit of hindsight. Afterwards, the leader''s task is to protect the people who were in it, because an operation that does not look after its officers after a serious incident loses them.', 'Ikibazo gikomeye kirenga ubushobozi busanzwe bw''akazi bityo gisaba ko imiterere itandukanye ishyirwa mu bikorwa aho gusaba ko isanzweho ikora cyane. Ubuyobozi mu bihe by''ikibazo butangira mbere y''ikibazo: kugena ibipimo byo gushyira mu bikorwa nk''imimerere aho kubigena nk''ibyemezo, kugira ngo itsinda ritamare iminota cumi n''itanu ya mbere ripfa niba ikibazo cyujuje; kumenya itsinda ricunga ikibazo ku murimo aho kurimenya ku muntu kugira ngo imiterere ibeho hari udahari; no kumenya ushobora kwemeza gukoresha amafaranga.

Mu gihe cy''ikibazo imirimo y''umuyobozi ni: gushyiraho no kugumana ishusho y''uko ibintu bimeze, izaba ituzuye kandi igomba gukorerwaho uko byaba byose; gufata ibyemezo byabitswe no guhereza ibindi abandi bigaragara; kugenzura itumanaho, harimo n''inshingano yo kumenyesha umuryango n''umukiriya mu kuri kandi mbere y''uko babyumva ahandi; no kwemeza ko buri cyemezo n''impamvu zacyo byanditse, kuko ibyemezo byafashwe hari amakuru atuzuye mu gitutu bizasuzumwa nyuma hamaze kumenyekana byose. Nyuma, umurimo w''umuyobozi ni ukurinda abantu bari muri cyo.', 12, 5);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_1, '183', 'Communication Leadership', 'Ubuyobozi mu Itumanaho', 'text', 'A leader in protective work communicates in four directions simultaneously and each requires something different. Downward to the detail: brief the same structure every time, confirm understanding individually rather than collectively, and explain the reason for an instruction where time allows, because officers who understand why comply durably while officers given only a rule comply until it is inconvenient. Upward to the client: report leading with what has changed, state risk in terms of exposure and consequence rather than security language, and never conceal a problem in the hope of resolving it first — a problem the client learns of from another source has damaged trust more than the problem itself.

Sideways to the principal and household: explain rather than instruct, and be unobtrusive and reliable, because cooperation is earned rather than demanded. And outward to external parties — venue security, police, other details: establish the relationship before it is needed, because a request made on the day to someone who has never met you receives a different answer from one made to someone you briefed a week earlier.', 'Umuyobozi mu murimo wo kurinda avugana mu byerekezo bine icyarimwe kandi buri kimwe gisaba ikintu gitandukanye. Hasi ku itsinda: menyesha imiterere imwe buri gihe, emeza gusobanukirwa kwa buri wese aho kubyemeza ku itsinda, kandi usobanure impamvu y''itegeko aho igihe cyemera, kuko abakozi basobanukiwe impamvu bakurikiza birambye mu gihe abakozi bahawe itegeko gusa bakurikiza kugeza ribabangamiye. Hejuru ku mukiriya: tanga raporo utangirira ku byahindutse, uvuge ibyago mu buryo bw''ibigaragara n''ingaruka aho kubivuga mu rurimi rw''umutekano, kandi ntukigere uhisha ikibazo wiringiye kubanza kugikemura.

Ku ruhande ku wo barinda no ku rugo: sobanura aho gutegeka, kandi ntugaragare cyane kandi ube uwizewe, kuko ubufatanye bwungurwa aho gusabwa. No hanze ku mpande zo hanze — umutekano w''ahantu, polisi, andi matsinda: shyiraho umubano mbere y''uko ukenerwa, kuko icyifuzo gitanzwe uwo munsi ku muntu utigeze aguhura gikira igisubizo gitandukanye n''icyatanzwe ku muntu wamenyesheje icyumweru mbere.', 12, 6);
