do $$ declare m_EP_V8_4 uuid; a_id uuid; q_id uuid; begin
  if not exists (select 1 from public.courses where id = 'EP-V8') then return; end if;
  insert into public.modules (course_id, number, title, title_rw, intro, intro_rw, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V8', 4, 'Development, Ethics and Professional Legacy', 'Iterambere, Ubunyangamugayo n''Umurage w''Umwuga', 'Subjects 196–200. This module closes the programme with mentoring and developing officers, ethical leadership, professional development, industry contribution and building a professional legacy.', 'Ingingo 196–200. Iki gice gisoza gahunda ku gutoza no guteza imbere abakozi, ubuyobozi bushingiye ku bunyangamugayo, iterambere ry''umwuga, uruhare mu rwego no kubaka umurage w''umwuga.', 4)
  returning id into m_EP_V8_4;
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_4, '196', 'Mentoring and Developing Officers', 'Gutoza no Guteza Imbere Abakozi', 'text', 'Developing officers is the highest-leverage activity available to a leader in this field, because the capability of the operation is the sum of the capability of its people and nothing else. Structured development follows a progression rather than being left to accumulate by exposure: an officer observes an experienced colleague, works alongside them, performs the task under observation, and then performs it independently with periodic review. At each stage feedback should be specific and behavioural rather than general — ''you did not confirm the medical journey time'' teaches something while ''be more thorough'' teaches nothing and is frequently heard as criticism rather than instruction.

Develop deliberately rather than only when a gap appears. Identify what each officer would need to hold the next role and build toward it, because an organisation that develops nobody is an organisation that must recruit externally for every promotion and loses its best people to employers who do develop them. And accept that developing an officer well means eventually losing them to a better role — an organisation unwilling to accept that produces officers who stay because they cannot leave, which is not the same as retention.', 'Guteza imbere abakozi ni cyo gikorwa gifite ingaruka nini gihari ku muyobozi muri uru rwego, kuko ubushobozi bw''ibikorwa ari igiteranyo cy''ubushobozi bw''abantu bacyo nta kindi. Iterambere riteguye rikurikiza urutonde aho kurekwa ngo ryiyongere ku bwo guhura: umukozi yitegereza mugenzi we w''inararibonye, agakorana na we, agakora umurimo agenzurwa, hanyuma akawukora wigenga asuzumwa ku gihe. Kuri buri cyiciro ibitekerezo bigomba kuba byihariye kandi bishingiye ku myitwarire aho kuba rusange — ''ntiwemeje igihe urugendo rwa muganga rumara'' bitanga isomo mu gihe ''ba wimbitse kurushaho'' nta cyo bitanga kandi akenshi byumvwa nk''ukunengwa aho kumvwa nk''inyigisho.

Toza ku bushake aho gutoza gusa igihe icyuho kigaragaye. Menya ibyo buri mukozi yakenera kugira ngo abone umurimo ukurikira wubake werekeza kuri byo, kuko ikigo kidateza imbere umuntu ari ikigo kigomba gushaka abantu hanze ku buri kuzamurwa kandi kigatakaza abantu bacyo beza. Kandi wemere ko guteza imbere umukozi neza bivuze amaherezo kumutakaza ajya ku murimo mwiza.', 12, 1);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_4, '197', 'Ethical Leadership', 'Ubuyobozi Bushingiye ku Bunyangamugayo', 'text', 'Ethical leadership in this field is largely a matter of what a leader does when the ethical position and the commercial position diverge, because they diverge regularly: an assignment worth taking that is beyond capability, a client who wants a recommendation softened, an officer who should not be deployed but is available, a problem that could be resolved quietly before anyone learns of it. In each case the ethical answer costs something immediately and the cost of the alternative is deferred, deniable and attributable to something else.

What a leader does in those moments is what the team learns the standard actually is. A leader who declines a venue on safety grounds and absorbs the commercial awkwardness has established something no policy statement could. A leader who deploys an unqualified officer once has established that qualifications are negotiable when the pressure is sufficient. Ethical leadership also means protecting people who raise problems, since an operation where reporting a concern carries a cost stops receiving concerns and the leader then leads an operation they cannot see. And it means accountability without evasion when something goes wrong — a leader who blames the team for a decision that was theirs has ended their authority permanently.', 'Ubuyobozi bushingiye ku bunyangamugayo muri uru rwego cyane cyane ni ikibazo cy''ibyo umuyobozi akora igihe umwanya w''ubunyangamugayo n''uw''ubucuruzi bitandukanye, kuko bitandukana kenshi: akazi gakwiye gufatwa ariko karenze ubushobozi, umukiriya ushaka ko icyifuzo cyorohezwa, umukozi utagomba gushyirwa ku murimo ariko ahari, ikibazo gishobora gukemurwa mu bwiherero mbere y''uko hagira ukimenya. Muri buri kimwe igisubizo cy''ubunyangamugayo gitwara ikintu ako kanya kandi ikiguzi cy''ubundi buryo gitinda, gishobora guhakanwa kandi kikitirirwa ikindi.

Ibyo umuyobozi akora muri utwo twanya ni byo itsinda ryiga ko urwego ari byo koko. Umuyobozi wanga ahantu ku mpamvu z''umutekano akakira ingorane y''ubucuruzi aba yashyizeho ikintu nta vuga rya politiki ryashoboraga. Umuyobozi ushyira ku murimo umukozi udafite icyemezo rimwe aba yashyizeho ko ibyemezo bivugwaho igihe igitutu gihagije. Ubuyobozi bw''ubunyangamugayo kandi busobanura kurinda abantu bavuga ibibazo, kuko ibikorwa aho gutanga impungenge bifite ikiguzi bihagarika kuzakira impungenge. Kandi busobanura kwibazwa utiruka igihe hari ikigenze nabi.', 12, 2);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_4, '198', 'Professional Development', 'Iterambere ry''Umwuga', 'text', 'A leader in this field has an obligation to their own development that is easy to defer indefinitely, because the operational demands are continuous and development is never urgent. The competencies that decay fastest are the practical ones — medical, drills, driving — which degrade measurably within months and where the degradation is invisible to the person concerned. Hold a current first aid or trauma qualification, maintain any practical certification the role requires, and refresh before expiry rather than after.

Beyond maintenance, develop in the directions the role is moving. A detail leader moving toward programme management needs planning, budgeting, contracting and people management rather than more operational skill. A professional moving toward consultancy needs assessment methodology and the ability to write. Recognised qualifications in risk management improve mobility substantially, as does an additional language. And read outside the field: the most useful contributions to protective thinking in the last two decades have come from behavioural science, crowd dynamics and human factors research rather than from within the industry, and a professional who reads only protective material is reading the field''s own assumptions back to themselves.', 'Umuyobozi muri uru rwego afite inshingano ku iterambere rye bwite byoroshye gutinza nta gihe ntarengwa, kuko ibisabwa mu kazi bikomeza kandi iterambere ritigera ryihutirwa. Ubumenyi bwangirika vuba kurusha ubundi ni ubufatika — ubwa muganga, imyitozo, gutwara — bwangirika bigaragara mu mezi make kandi aho ukwangirika kutagaragarira uwo bireba. Gira icyemezo kigezweho cy''ubufasha bwa mbere cyangwa cy''ibikomere, bungabunga icyemezo cyose gifatika umurimo usaba, kandi uvugurure mbere y''uko kirangira aho kubikora nyuma.

Hejuru yo kubungabunga, itere imbere mu byerekezo umurimo ugana. Umuyobozi w''itsinda werekeza ku micungire ya gahunda akeneye igenamigambi, ingengo y''imari, amasezerano n''imicungire y''abantu aho gukenera ubumenyi bw''akazi bwinshi. Umunyamwuga werekeza ku bujyanama akeneye uburyo bwo gusuzuma n''ubushobozi bwo kwandika. Ibyemezo byemewe mu micungire y''ibyago byongera cyane ubushobozi bwo kwimuka, nk''uko urundi rurimi rubikora. Kandi soma hanze y''uru rwego: uruhare rufite akamaro kurusha izindi mu bitekerezo byo kurinda mu myaka makumyabiri ishize rwavuye mu bumenyi bw''imyitwarire, imyitwarire y''imbaga n''ubushakashatsi ku bantu aho kuva mu rwego ubwarwo.', 12, 3);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_4, '199', 'Industry Contribution', 'Uruhare mu Rwego', 'text', 'A profession improves through the accumulated contribution of its practitioners, and protective work has historically been poor at this because its culture of discretion — which is correct and necessary — has also produced a reluctance to share anything at all. The two are separable: an officer can contribute methodology, analysis and lessons without ever disclosing a principal, an assignment or a client, and the professionals who have advanced this field have done exactly that.

Contribute where you can. Train others, formally or by mentoring, because a practitioner who trains nobody has removed their experience from the profession on the day they leave it. Participate in professional bodies where they exist, since standards are set by those who show up. Share anonymised lessons and methodology, particularly failures, because near-misses and errors teach more than successes and are almost never published for exactly the reason that they should be. Engage with regulation constructively rather than resisting it reflexively, since a sector that does not set its own standards has them set for it. And be honest publicly about what the work actually is, because a profession whose public image is built on drama attracts entrants who want drama.', 'Umwuga uranozwa binyuze mu ruhare rwakusanyijwe rw''abawukora, kandi umurimo wo kurinda mu mateka wabaye mubi muri ibi kuko umuco wawo w''ubushishozi — uri wo kandi ukenewe — na wo wabyaye kutashaka gusangira ikintu na kimwe. Byombi birashobora gutandukanywa: umukozi ashobora gutanga uburyo, isesengura n''amasomo atigeze atangaza uwo barinda, akazi cyangwa umukiriya, kandi abanyamwuga bateje imbere uru rwego bakoze neza ibyo.

Tanga uruhare aho ushoboye. Hugura abandi, ku mugaragaro cyangwa mu gutoza, kuko ukora atahugura umuntu aba yakuye uburambe bwe mu mwuga ku munsi awuvuyeho. Gira uruhare mu miryango y''umwuga aho ihari, kuko amabwiriza ashyirwaho n''abaza. Sangira amasomo n''uburyo bitanditse amazina, cyane cyane amakosa, kuko ibyari hafi kubaho n''amakosa byigisha byinshi kurusha ibyatsinze kandi hafi ntibigera bitangazwa ku mpamvu nyayo yatuma bigomba gutangazwa. Gira uruhare mu mategeko mu buryo bunoza aho kuyarwanya, kuko urwego rutishyiriraho amabwiriza rurayashyirirwaho. Kandi ube umunyakuri ku mugaragaro ku byo umurimo ari byo koko.', 12, 4);
  insert into public.lessons (module_id, number, title, title_rw, kind, body, body_rw, duration_minutes, sort_order)
  values (m_EP_V8_4, '200', 'Building a Professional Legacy', 'Kubaka Umurage w''Umwuga', 'text', 'This is the final subject in the programme and it returns to where Volume 1 began. The measure of a protective professional is not the principals they protected, the incidents they handled or the years they served — it is what continues to function after they leave. A detail that collapses when its leader departs was never a detail; it was one person''s practice. A programme that depends on one person''s attention is not a programme. An improvement that lives only in one manager''s habits disappears with them.

Build for continuity deliberately. Document decisions and the reasoning behind them rather than only the outcomes, so that a successor inherits the thinking rather than rediscovering it. Develop the people who will hold the role after you and accept that developing them well means eventually losing them. Capture improvements in the standards and templates rather than in your own practice. And hold the standard consistently over years, because institutional identity is nothing more than a philosophy applied without exception for long enough that it becomes what people expect.

The legacy of a protective professional is measured in the competence of officers they never personally worked alongside, and in the uneventful days of principals they never met. Discipline. Vigilance. Protection.', 'Iyi ni ngingo ya nyuma muri gahunda kandi igarukira aho Igitabo cya 1 cyatangiriye. Igipimo cy''umunyamwuga wo kurinda ntabwo ari abo yarinze, ibibazo yacyuye cyangwa imyaka yakoze — ni ibikomeza gukora amaze kugenda. Itsinda risenyuka umuyobozi waryo agiye ntiryigeze riba itsinda; ryari ibikorwa by''umuntu umwe. Gahunda ishingiye ku bwitonzi bw''umuntu umwe si gahunda. Impinduka ibaho gusa mu mico y''umuyobozi umwe izimirana na we.

Ubaka ku bwo gukomeza ku bushake. Andika ibyemezo n''impamvu ziri inyuma yabyo aho kwandika ibyavuyemo gusa, kugira ngo uzagusimbura ahabwe imitekerereze aho kuyibonera bundi bushya. Toza abantu bazafata umurimo nyuma yawe kandi wemere ko kubatoza neza bivuze amaherezo kubatakaza. Andika impinduka mu mabwiriza no mu ngero aho kuzandika mu bikorwa byawe. Kandi ugumishe urwego ruhoraho mu myaka, kuko umwirondoro w''ikigo utari ikindi uretse imyumvire ikurikizwa nta kirengagizwa igihe kirekire ku buryo iba ari yo abantu bategereza.

Umurage w''umunyamwuga wo kurinda upimwa mu bushobozi bw''abakozi atigeze akorana na bo ubwe, no mu minsi nta cyabaho y''abo barinda atigeze ahura na bo. Umurava. Kuba Maso. Kurinda.', 12, 5);
  insert into public.assessments (course_id, module_id, title, title_rw, kind, pass_mark, sort_order)
  values ('EP-V8', m_EP_V8_4, 'Quiz — Development, Ethics and Professional Legacy', 'Ikizamini — Iterambere, Ubunyangamugayo n''Umurage w''Umwuga', 'quiz', 70, 4)
  returning id into a_id;
